WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.893
Week 33: History, Society, and Multiple Perspectives. summarize a historical development distinguish fact from interpretation compare perspectives

2
00:00:09.893 --> 00:00:17.012
Mission brief. Present a contested historical event using two perspectives and clearly sourced evidence.

3
00:00:17.012 --> 00:00:26.395
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:26.395 --> 00:00:34.091
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:34.091 --> 00:00:42.533
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:42.533 --> 00:01:19.863
Model language. La fuente afirma que la reforma amplió derechos. — The source states that the reform expanded rights. Otros sostienen que la desigualdad continuó. — Others maintain that inequality continued. Cuando cambió el gobierno, muchas personas ya habían emigrado. — When the government changed, many people had already emigrated. Aunque existe consenso sobre los hechos, su significado se debate. — Although there is consensus about the facts, their meaning is debated. El testimonio aporta una perspectiva personal. — The testimony provides a personal perspective.

7
00:01:19.863 --> 00:01:29.611
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
